   "page": "android",
   "text": "Sample data only.\nActivity data comes from WHOOP through its API (steps, strain, heart rate, recovery, sleep, workouts), so it is the same on any phone and on the trainer page.\nWHOOP gives heart-rate summaries, not a minute-by-minute line.\nEvery screen has a Dark switch in Tweaks; the light row shows the same screens with it off.\nSign in: the real app shows Google's own sign-in button through Android's Credential Manager; the one drawn here is a stand-in."
